ent-CMUCavernPebbles = scattered basalt
    .desc = Small fragments of stone worn smooth underground.
ent-CMUCavernStalagmite = limestone outcrop
    .desc = Mineral deposits left by water dripping through the rock.
ent-CMUCavernCrystal = cavern crystal
    .desc = A pale crystal formation. It contains no recoverable ore.
ent-CMUCavernMineral = amber mineral growth
    .desc = A weathered mineral formation. It contains no recoverable ore.
ent-CMUCavernDeadFungi = desiccated fungal colony
    .desc = Brittle caps left by a dead subterranean ecosystem.
ent-CMUCavernDeadRoots = dead root mat
    .desc = A dry web of roots. Nothing here is growing anymore.
ent-CMUCavernVent = dormant vent
    .desc = A fractured mineral seam. No gas is escaping at present.
ent-CMUCavernWater = cavern water
    .desc = Cold water pooled on a natural rock shelf. Wading slows your movement.
ent-CMUCavernLava = exposed lava
    .desc = Molten rock pooled on the cavern floor. Contact can set you on fire.
ent-CMUCavernSpring = mineral spring
    .desc = Mineral-rich water collected in a shallow basin. Wading slows your movement.
